        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.67,
          "end": 197.5,
          "en": "And then we need to add the options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 197.5,
          "end": 200.893,
          "en": "And here we'll have 12 options because we have 12 months.",
