        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 331.32,
          "end": 333.2,
          "en": "So if that is set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 333.2,
          "end": 337.74,
          "en": "And if it is I'll return my link as I did before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 337.74,
          "end": 340.40999999999997,
          "en": "Otherwise, if we make it past this if check,",
