          "end": 414.96,
          "en": "To this first div we then add classes.controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 414.96,
          "end": 417.9,
          "en": "And those divs only exist for the styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 417.9,
          "end": 420.343,
          "en": "That's why I have these nested divs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 421.35,
          "end": 424.89,
          "en": "Then here I'll have another div with a class of control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 424.89,
          "end": 429.61,
          "en": "So the outer div has controls, the inner div has control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 429.61,
          "end": 433.62,
          "en": "And we don't need to add anything to the label ends on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 433.62,
          "end": 436.043,
          "en": "but this div here which holds the month,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 436.979,
          "end": 440.94,
          "en": "also receives classes.control like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
